@startuml 05-sequence-secrets
title FlowAI Platform - Secret Lifecycle (sequence)

autonumber

participant "Operator" as Op
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Secret Registry" as SecretRegistry
participant "Automation" as Auto
participant "Router" as Router
participant "Executor" as EX
participant "Agent Container" as AG

note over Op, SecretRegistry
  GW is an auth-aware reverse proxy. UI -> GW (auth) -> SecretRegistry.
  GW only does auth + route. No business logic.
  All writes happen in backend services.
end note

== Operator creates secret (write-only at UI/GW) ==

Op -> UI : Open Secrets page
UI -> GW : POST /secrets { bearer_token, name, value, scope }
GW -> GW : Validate bearer_token
GW -> SecretRegistry : POST /secrets { name, value, scope }
SecretRegistry -> SecretRegistry : Encrypt, persist (audit logged)
SecretRegistry --> GW : 201 secret_id
GW --> UI : 201 secret_id
UI --> Op : Secret saved

note over Auto, EX
  Task time. Automation submits via REST to the Router
  with a bearer token from GW.
end note

== Submit (automation -> Router direct) ==

Auto -> GW : POST /auth/login
GW --> Auto : 200 { bearer_token }
Auto -> Router : REST POST /tasks { bearer_token, prompt, tools, secret_ids: [a, b] }
Router -> Router : Build scope = HMAC(project_id, task_id, secret_ids, TTL)
Router -> Router : Persist task (incl. scope_token + routing_target) in Router DB
Router --> Auto : 202 task_id

== Dispatch (Router dispatches via REST) ==

Router -> Router : Pick next pending task from Router DB
Router -> EX : REST POST /dispatch { task_spec + scope_token }
EX -> EX : Pull image

== Secret resolve at task start ==

EX -> SecretRegistry : REST open env { scope_token }
SecretRegistry -> SecretRegistry : Validate scope signature, expiry, project
SecretRegistry --> EX : env-style map { SECRET_A=..., SECRET_B=... }
EX -> AG : Start container, mount env-style keys (env / tmpfs)

note over AG
  Has secrets from start. No runtime fetch needed unless refreshed.
end note

note over AG, EX
  On task end. Container terminated. Scope token expires. Plaintext gone.
end note

@enduml
